emotion, stale-marker, refresh) all routing through T39 proposals; `stale_marker.rs` + `refresh.rs` ship in this task per spec bullets.\n- **T42**: four LLM jobs with mode guard forbidding synchronous mode; malformed responses leave memory unchanged and emit `ConsolidationFailed` event.\n- **T43**: SHA-256 prompt/response hashes, per-kind queue bounds, budget catalog with fallback strategies, and the architecture doc at `docs/architecture/2026-05-16-consolidation-llm-budgets.md`.\n- **T44**: scope-gated manual review queue for repo + organization.\n- **T45**: replay-safe execution, reversal, cached-provenance replay (live LLM never called).\n- **T46**: integration tests covering proposals, apply/reject, replay, queue bounds, failure events.\n- **R47**: review with required headings (`## Spec alignment`, `## Coding-standard alignment`, `## Proposal discipline`, `## LLM budget evidence`, `## Findings`, `## Verdict`).\n- **T48**: eight-state output model verbatim, file/symbol/doc/test existence, `verification_jobs` table.\n- **T49**: exact-span content hashing, encoding-flip distinguished from content change, no whole-file reads.\n- **T50**: `ScopeFilter` enforced at store boundary, negative tests for all four scopes, `MemoryScopeFiltered` event.\n- **T51**: time-bound expiry, incremental verification narrowed to changed files/symbols, bounded work budget, snapshot-id advance on success.\n- **T52**: `SurfacingPipeline::partition` enforcing trusted vs advisory split, exhaustive `classify` match, ranker hard precondition excluding non-`Verified`.\n- **T53**: integration tests proving stale never trusted + scope leakage blocked across all eight states and all four scopes.\n- **R54**: review with required headings (`## Spec alignment`, `## Coding-standard alignment`, `## Stale-label discipline`, `## Scope-leak evidence`, `## Findings`, `## Verdict`).\n- **R55**: cross-layer contract gate with required headings; ships new test file `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/contract_t