docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/logs/T04.log:8043:+This directory stores the Phase 0 baseline required by `## Phase 0: Fork Foundation` in [docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md](/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md:566). The purpose is to measure the current Lattice workflow hot paths before the fork-build phases change identity resolution, event capture, retrieval, or metrics behavior.
docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/logs/T04.log:8045:+The benchmark suite is implemented in [daemon/crates/lattice-core/benches/baseline_workflows.rs](/home/pete/cadres/lattice/daemon/crates/lattice-core/benches/baseline_workflows.rs:1). It uses a deterministic temp-workspace fixture, runs the current workflow logic with `cargo bench`, and rewrites `baseline_metrics.json` on every successful run.
